sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Client<br/>(Dashboard / CLI)
    participant Route as OpenShift Route<br/>80/TCP HTTP
    participant Service as TrustyAI Service<br/>8080/TCP HTTP<br/>4443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Storage as Storage Backend<br/>(PVC / MinIO / MariaDB)
    participant ModelMesh as ModelMesh / KServe<br/>Model Servers
    participant Prometheus as Prometheus<br/>(ServiceMonitor)

    Note over Service: Flow 1: Inference Payload Ingestion
    ModelMesh->>Service: POST /consumer/kserve/v2<br/>HTTP 80/TCP, No Auth
    Service->>Storage: Store inference payload<br/>(Filesystem / HTTP / JDBC)
    Storage-->>Service: Acknowledgment

    Note over Service: Flow 2: Scheduled Metric Computation
    loop Every 5s (SERVICE_METRICS_SCHEDULE)
        Service->>Storage: Read stored inference data
        Storage-->>Service: Inference payloads
        Service->>Service: Compute SPD, DIR,<br/>KS Test, Fourier MMD metrics
        Service->>Service: Update Prometheus gauges<br/>(trustyai_spd, trustyai_dir)
    end

    Note over Prometheus,Service: Flow 2 (continued): Prometheus Scrape
    Prometheus->>Service: GET /q/metrics<br/>HTTP 80/TCP<br/>Auth: Bearer SA token
    Service-->>Prometheus: Prometheus gauge values<br/>(trustyai_spd, trustyai_dir)

    Note over Client,Service: Flow 3: On-Demand Metric Request
    Client->>Route: POST /metrics/group/fairness/spd<br/>HTTP 80/TCP
    Route->>Service: Forward request
    Service->>Storage: Read inference data
    Storage-->>Service: Data
    Service->>Service: Compute SPD metric
    Service-->>Route: JSON response
    Route-->>Client: Metric result

    Note over Client,ModelMesh: Flow 4: Explainability (ODH only, disabled in RHOAI)
    Client->>Route: POST /explainers/local/lime<br/>HTTP 80/TCP
    Route->>Service: Forward request
    Service->>ModelMesh: gRPC / HTTP inference query
    ModelMesh-->>Service: Model predictions
    Service->>Service: Compute LIME explanation
    Service-->>Route: JSON explanation
    Route-->>Client: Explanation result
